# Resend API key for the contact form.
#
# Read SERVER-SIDE by the Worker (worker/contact.ts) — never exposed to the
# browser, so there is no VITE_ prefix.
#
# Create one at https://resend.com/api-keys (permission "Sending access",
# domain kodek.hr). kodek.hr must be verified in Resend (Domains) first.
#
# Local dev:   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars, paste the key, then
#              npm run dev:worker   (builds dist/ and runs `wrangler dev`)
#              Plain `vite dev` does NOT serve /api/contact.
#
# Production:  npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#              or Workers & Pages -> kodek -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets.
RESEND_API_KEY=
